WEBVTT

1
00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:02.375
In verses 13.31 to 13.33,

2
00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.375
Lord Krishna explains the eternal

3
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:07.250
and indestructible nature of the soul.

4
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.916
He says that the soul neither takes birth,

5
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:11.958
nor dies,

6
00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:12.541
nor is

7
00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:15.708
affected by the changes of the body.

8
00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.750
When this vision develops,

9
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:21.541
a person rises above material
differences and changes,

10
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:23.166
and is able to see the Paramatma

11
00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:26.333
equally present in all.

12
00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:27.958
This understanding brings

13
00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:31.875
stability, equanimity, and compassion to life,

14
00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:34.875
and leads us toward liberation

15
00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:37.041
from the cycle of birth and death.

16
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:44.000
Lord Krishna explains here

17
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.875
that one who sees

18
00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:47.250
that all the different beings

19
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.833
merge into one Prakriti

20
00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:50.291
at the end of creation –

21
00:01:50.291 --> 00:01:52.333
the dissolution –

22
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:54.916
and again emerge from that same Prakriti

23
00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:56.750
at the beginning of creation –

24
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.291
attains Brahma-drishti, the vision of Brahman.

25
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:00.625
This means that

26
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.166
when someone understands that
the bodies of gods,

27
00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:06.625
humans, animals, or plants

28
00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:08.958
are only temporary expressions

29
00:02:08.958 --> 00:02:12.041
of material nature, they rise above

30
00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:15.083
body-based identity.

31
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:16.166
At the time of dissolution,

32
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:16.958
all beings

33
00:02:16.958 --> 00:02:17.958
disappear

34
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:20.500
and merge into the unmanifest Prakriti.

35
00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.000
And when creation begins again,

36
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.166
they appear in various forms

37
00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:27.458
according to their past karma.

38
00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:28.750
But the soul

39
00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.666
remains untouched by this entire process.

40
00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:35.250
One who understands this eternal truth

41
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.250
becomes free from discrimination

42
00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:41.125
based on caste, species, or position.

43
00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:43.833
They come to understand that all beings,

44
00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:45.833
though different in outer form,

45
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:49.375
are parts of the same spiritual truth.

46
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:52.333
This knowledge is Brahma-drishti – where

47
00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:55.375
the unity hidden within diversity
becomes visible,

48
00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.416
and a feeling of equality

49
00:02:57.416 --> 00:03:00.125
and peace comes into life.

50
00:03:00.125 --> 00:03:03.625
Verse 13.32 – Lord Krishna describes

51
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:08.041
how a person with Brahma-drishti sees the soul.

52
00:03:08.041 --> 00:03:09.500
Lord Krishna says

53
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.791
that such a person regards the
soul as indestructible, divine,

54
00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:15.166
eternal, and beyond the qualities

55
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:16.833
of Prakriti.

56
00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:20.250
Although the soul resides in the body, it neither

57
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.750
performs material actions

58
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.583
nor gets entangled in them.

59
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:27.333
Lord Krishna clarifies this point

60
00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:30.333
in this way – just as

61
00:03:30.333 --> 00:03:33.833
a lotus flower is not affected by the water

62
00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:37.416
in which it blooms, in the same way the soul

63
00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:42.041
remains unaffected by the body’s
changes and actions.

64
00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:45.291
Birth, growth, decay, and death –

65
00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:49.000
these are all qualities of the body,
not of the soul.

66
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.583
Through this understanding,
the false identification

67
00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:54.083
with the body ends,

68
00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:55.458
and vairagya –

69
00:03:55.458 --> 00:03:57.916
detachment – arises in the person.

70
00:03:57.916 --> 00:04:00.000
One who knows this truth

71
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.750
remains unaffected by material dualities

72
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.208
and gradually moves forward

73
00:04:05.208 --> 00:04:08.833
on the path of liberation.

74
00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:10.791
Verse 13.33 – Lord Krishna

75
00:04:10.791 --> 00:04:12.916
gives a beautiful analogy –

76
00:04:12.916 --> 00:04:16.083
just as the sky, though pervading everything,

77
00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:17.916
does not mix with anything

78
00:04:17.916 --> 00:04:20.000
due to its subtlety,

79
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.000
in the same way the soul too, though residing

80
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.541
in the body, does not mix with it.

81
00:04:24.541 --> 00:04:28.625
The sky spreads over mountains, rivers,

82
00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:30.708
cities, and forests –

83
00:04:30.708 --> 00:04:33.166
but does not blend into them.

84
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:35.250
The soul too resides in the body,

85
00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.125
but remains unaffected

86
00:04:37.125 --> 00:04:40.958
by the body’s changes, desires, and sorrows.

87
00:04:40.958 --> 00:04:42.833
The sky, though close

88
00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:46.000
to impure things, is not made impure by them –

89
00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.583
the soul too, though residing

90
00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:50.250
in a body made of material elements,

91
00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.500
remains pure and untouched.

92
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.000
This analogy clarifies the subtlety

93
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.375
and transcendent nature of the soul.

94
00:04:59.375 --> 00:05:02.125
Like the relationship between
the sky and objects,

95
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:05.583
the relationship between the soul and the body

96
00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:06.416
is also

97
00:05:06.416 --> 00:05:09.000
close yet separate – there is connection,

98
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.958
but no bondage.

99
00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:14.041
By recognising this distinction,
a person develops spiritual vision 

100
00:05:14.041 --> 00:05:19.083
and is able to end attachment
to the temporary body.

101
00:05:23.916 --> 00:05:27.541
Sometimes moments come in life

102
00:05:27.541 --> 00:05:29.750
when you feel stuck –

103
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.333
caught in circumstances, failures,

104
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:34.875
or the bonds of the past.

105
00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:38.541
You begin to consider yourself the cause

106
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:39.791
of the things that did not go right,

107
00:05:39.791 --> 00:05:41.833
that you never received, or

108
00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:45.000
that others have said about you.

109
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:49.708
And slowly, without realising, you
begin to believe –

110
00:05:49.708 --> 00:05:51.666
‘This is who I am.’

111
00:05:51.666 --> 00:05:55.583
But the truth is far deeper than this –

112
00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:59.666
your real identity is not your sorrows, the labels

113
00:05:59.666 --> 00:06:01.500
placed on you, your body,

114
00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.666
or your circumstances.

115
00:06:04.666 --> 00:06:07.458
You are the soul – eternal,

116
00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:11.708
unchanging, and pure!

117
00:06:11.708 --> 00:06:13.416
Just as however many birds

118
00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:15.500
may fly in the sky,

119
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.041
the sky does not change because of them –

120
00:06:18.041 --> 00:06:23.750
in the same way the storms of life
cannot even touch you.

121
00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.000
This is not a denial of truth –

122
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.083
this itself is the truth.

123
00:06:29.083 --> 00:06:32.208
Yes, your body will change,

124
00:06:32.208 --> 00:06:35.375
emotions will rise and fall,

125
00:06:35.375 --> 00:06:39.291
the mind will sometimes feel heavy –
but your reality

126
00:06:39.291 --> 00:06:41.375
is beyond all of this.

127
00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:46.958
When you begin to remember
your spiritual identity,

128
00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:49.000
you stop binding yourself

129
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:53.041
to your problems –

130
00:06:53.041 --> 00:06:54.541
and begin to live

131
00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:57.583
with dignity and lightness.

132
00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:00.000
So do not let today’s problems

133
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.625
become the definition of your entire life.

134
00:07:04.625 --> 00:07:09.041
You are far more than that. You always were.

135
00:07:09.041 --> 00:07:13.916
And now the time has come to live that way.

136
00:07:18.625 --> 00:07:21.000
It is a very natural thing

137
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:25.333
to care for family members! Because

138
00:07:25.333 --> 00:07:27.375
everyone wants to see their loved ones

139
00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:31.125
in the best possible condition –

140
00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:33.375
and sometimes this very love

141
00:07:33.375 --> 00:07:36.541
begins to affect us deeply within.

142
00:07:36.541 --> 00:07:41.000
So much that the mind fills with worry,

143
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.041
and you

144
00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:46.041
begin to control their lives.

145
00:07:46.041 --> 00:07:49.625
Then slowly, the inner energy

146
00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:53.333
and enthusiasm begin to fade.

147
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:55.250
But remember –

148
00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:58.458
you can face the difficulties of every situation

149
00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:03.666
while still remaining unaffected by them.

150
00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:06.125
See, just as in this verse

151
00:08:06.125 --> 00:08:08.916
I have given the analogy of the sky.

152
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:11.833
The sky spreads over rivers,

153
00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:15.833
cities, mountains –

154
00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:19.875
even over chaos – yet it does not
get involved in them.

155
00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.875
It is simply present –

156
00:08:21.875 --> 00:08:25.583
vast, steady, and clear.

157
00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:27.000
You too must learn

158
00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.625
to become like this in your family!

159
00:08:30.625 --> 00:08:34.125
Present, yet unattached!

160
00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:38.833
Yes – when someone needs to talk,

161
00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:40.541
be available.

162
00:08:40.541 --> 00:08:42.000
Give your support,

163
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.625
your wisdom, your love –

164
00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:48.750
but do not let any conflict, decision, or outcome

165
00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:53.166
snatch away your inner peace.

166
00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:55.791
If your child makes a mistake,

167
00:08:55.791 --> 00:08:58.208
give guidance –

168
00:08:58.208 --> 00:08:59.791
not panic.

169
00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:01.125
If there are differences,

170
00:09:01.125 --> 00:09:04.125
let them express their side –

171
00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:06.041
do not get angry.

172
00:09:06.041 --> 00:09:07.500
Understand –

173
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:11.208
vairagya does not mean being indifferent.

174
00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:12.250
It means –

175
00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:16.750
to care with clarity and balance.

176
00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:20.041
When you do this, your family

177
00:09:20.041 --> 00:09:23.541
feels the warmth of your affection –

178
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:26.541
not the burden of your stress.

179
00:09:26.541 --> 00:09:29.833
You become a shelter, not a storm.

180
00:09:29.833 --> 00:09:30.875
And gradually,

181
00:09:30.875 --> 00:09:34.958
your presence becomes the peace

182
00:09:34.958 --> 00:09:38.583
that holds everyone together.

183
00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.166
In leadership, you are expected

184
00:09:46.166 --> 00:09:48.791
to stay connected with everyone –

185
00:09:48.791 --> 00:09:51.458
to understand your team’s challenges,

186
00:09:51.458 --> 00:09:53.750
to take interest in their progress.

187
00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.416
But many times what happens is

188
00:09:55.416 --> 00:09:56.458
that you take everything

189
00:09:56.458 --> 00:09:58.625
onto your own shoulders.

190
00:09:58.625 --> 00:10:01.000
You get emotionally entangled
in every problem,

191
00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.458
every decision, every outcome –

192
00:10:04.458 --> 00:10:08.875
and slowly this exhausts you from within.

193
00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:12.708
Here you must develop a perspective –

194
00:10:12.708 --> 00:10:13.916
just as the soul,

195
00:10:13.916 --> 00:10:15.208
while residing in the body,

196
00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:18.166
does not get entangled with it,

197
00:10:18.166 --> 00:10:22.166
just as the sky – though
spread over everything –

198
00:10:22.166 --> 00:10:24.500
does not mix with anything.

199
00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:29.625
The same kind of balance must
exist in leadership.

200
00:10:29.625 --> 00:10:32.208
Be fully present

201
00:10:32.208 --> 00:10:33.708
for your team –

202
00:10:33.708 --> 00:10:36.833
listen, give guidance, inspire –

203
00:10:36.833 --> 00:10:41.000
but do not feel the need to wear yourself out

204
00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.833
in every conflict, or to keep complete control

205
00:10:44.833 --> 00:10:47.000
over every situation.

206
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.166
Just as the sky gives clouds space
to pass through,

207
00:10:50.166 --> 00:10:53.458
in the same way give your team space to grow –

208
00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:56.750
even space to stumble –

209
00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:59.791
without becoming anxious or angry.

210
00:10:59.791 --> 00:11:03.666
This balance of connection and
emotional distance

211
00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:08.083
makes your presence calm and steady.

212
00:11:08.083 --> 00:11:11.791
The team feels your support,

213
00:11:11.791 --> 00:11:14.791
and does not come under pressure.

214
00:11:14.791 --> 00:11:16.625
They know

215
00:11:16.625 --> 00:11:19.875
that you care for them –

216
00:11:19.875 --> 00:11:22.000
and also trust them enough

217
00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.291
to let them move forward on their own.

218
00:11:25.291 --> 00:11:26.000
This is not

219
00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.500
merely leadership – it is guidance.

220
00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.666
And it creates a culture where people

221
00:11:33.666 --> 00:11:38.833
flourish in both responsibility and freedom.
